  ],
  "summary": "Acronis TRU used VirusTotal Livehunt/retrohunt YARA hunting to track three campaigns: SideWinder's South Asian maldoc chain abusing CVE-2017-0199/CVE-2017-11882 with geofenced empty-RTF decoys, the Colombian Shadow Vector campaign using judicial-themed SVG lures with embedded HTTPS payload links, and the FileFix ClickFix variant that copies a PowerShell command to the clipboard and extracts an executable from a downloaded JPG. Detection anchors include the SideWinder decoy RTF hash and hex patterns, the Spanish judicial lure strings plus the 'Generado Automaticamente' generator marker in SVGs, and the clipboard-copy JavaScript/PowerShell deobfuscation chain used by FileFix.",
  "mitre_techniques": [
    "T1203",
    "T1204.001",
    "T1204.002"
  ],
